 for finding the root cause. This made it trivial to fix. https://github.com/google/iree/pull/7215 solves the problem","created_at":"2021-09-30T03:35:49Z","html_url":"https://github.com/iree-org/iree/issues/7187#issuecomment-930752764","id":930752764,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/7187","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDODGgK6M43eij8","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/930752764/reactions"},"updated_at":"2021-09-30T03:35:49Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/930752764","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24322263?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ThomasRaoux","id":24322263,"login":"ThomasRaoux","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzIyMjYz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24322263?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ThomasRaoux","id":24322263,"login":"ThomasRaoux","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzIyMjYz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux","user_view_type":"public"},"assignees":[{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24322263?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ThomasRaoux","id":24322263,"login":"ThomasRaoux","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzIyMjYz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux","user_view_type":"public"}],"author_association":"NONE","body":"**Describe the bug**\r\nI used Npcomp to lower a Resnet18 model. The first dimension (batch) is unknown at this stage. \r\nI've noticed that there is this fix (https://github.com/google/iree/pull/6957) to the CUDA backend to support dynamic shapes so I want to give it a try. So I used iree-translate to compile the model.\r\n\r\nHowever, I got this error during compilation:\r\n\r\n> iree-translate: /mnt/workspace/holmes/third_party/llvm-project/mlir/include/mlir/IR/Types.h:235: bool mlir::Type::isa() const [U = mlir::LLVM::LLVMVoidType]: Assertion `impl && \"isa<> used on a null type.\"' failed.\r\n> PLEASE submit a bug report to https://bugs.llvm.org/ and include the crash backtrace.\r\n\r\nThe stack trace is here:https://gist.github.com/hunbssfy/a8a8659352c7df2877cb004c5c5a376e\r\n\r\nI debugged a little bit and I found that there are three `hal.interface.bindings` in the symbol-table before `ConvertToNVVM` while in a normal state there should be two (the other one is a constant rather than a function argument...), in other words, the number of `hal.interface.bindings` and `hal.interface.bindings.subspan` mismatches in the IR. I posted my IR before convert-to-nvvm here: https://gist.github.com/hunbssfy/eac40ad3c3fd1dd6893ccbac5b79ade3\r\n\r\nAnd this caused there are three \"Arg mappings\" generated here: https://github.com/google/iree/blob/7bc297e9fc8bcc7f291d84e8854a44d5161f2cd6/iree/compiler/Codegen/LLVMGPU/ConvertToLLVM.cpp#L169 during a walk of the symbol table. But only two elements in `llvmInputTypes` were populated when visiting all the `hal.interface.bindings.subspan` afterwards: https://github.com/google/iree/blob/7bc297e9fc8bcc7f291d84e8854a44d5161f2cd6/iree/compiler/Codegen/LLVMGPU/ConvertToLLVM.cpp#L171\r\nThe one left unmodified was a NULL type which lead to verification failure here: https://github.com/google/iree/blob/7bc297e9fc8bcc7f291d84e8854a44d5161f2cd6/iree/compiler/Codegen/LLVMGPU/ConvertToLLVM.cpp#L200\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\n**I am not using the latest iree build, I am using this tag: snapshot-20210914.525**\r\n1. Build iree\r\n2. Download the Resnet18 model: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1AwdJatbhAaBlFoYx-UcFd4vj2wN37D8g/view?usp=sharing\r\n\r\n3. ` iree-translate resnet18_batch_unknown.mlir --iree-input-type=none --iree-vm-bytecode-module-output-format=flatbuffer-binary --iree-hal-target-backends=cuda --iree-mlir-to-vm-bytecode-module --mlir-print-debuginfo --mlir-disable-threading --mlir-print-op-on-diagnostic=false --mlir-elide-elementsattrs-if-larger=100 --print-ir-after-failure --print-ir-before=iree-convert-to-nvvm`\r\n\r\nAnd @ThomasRaoux Could you help me take a look? Thanks!","closed_at":"2021-09-30T16:09:28Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24322263?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ThomasRaoux","id":24322263,"login":"ThomasRaoux","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzIyMjYz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux","user_view_type":"public"},"comments":2,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/7187/comments","created_at":"2021-09-27T03:02:51Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/7187/events","html_url":"https://github.com/iree-org/iree/issues/7187","id":1007633250,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":false,"description":"Something isn't working","id":1553038945,"name":"bug 🐞","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNTUz